{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_research_2026_09_01_runs_on_atlassian_badge_research_note", "label": "Research note: recovering the Runs on Atlassian badge (2026-09-01)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/research/2026-09-01-runs-on-atlassian-badge.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Can the app have the badge while running agent/tools/ unchanged? Keeping the Cloud Run calculator: blocked. Pyodide in a Forge function: works, measured on a throwaway app, byte-identical figures, ten times native CPU."}, {"id": "docs_research_2026_09_01_runs_on_atlassian_badge_runs_on_atlassian_eligibility", "label": "Runs on Atlassian eligibility criteria", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/research/2026-09-01-runs-on-atlassian-badge.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Atlassian-hosted compute and storage only, matching data residency, customer-controlled egress. Eligible apps list no external resource domains, remotes, Connect modules, providers or dynamic web triggers; the analytics exception is narrow."}, {"id": "docs_research_2026_09_01_runs_on_atlassian_badge_remote_costs_eligibility", "label": "Declaring a remote costs eligibility before any traffic", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/research/2026-09-01-runs-on-atlassian-badge.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The disqualifier list is of manifest declarations, not traffic; forge eligibility at 5.0.0 reports 'using remote services' and 'egressing data' from the calculator remote alone."}, {"id": "docs_research_2026_09_01_runs_on_atlassian_badge_pyodide_in_forge_function", "label": "Pyodide inside a Forge function", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/research/2026-09-01-runs-on-atlassian-badge.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "WebAssembly instantiates in the native Node runtime; a warm container keeps the loaded runtime so the 6.8 s cold load is paid once per container. Facts/forecast 1.3-1.5 s warm; sequencing 13.6 s warm, ~21 s cold, against a 25 s resolver timeout."}, {"id": "docs_research_2026_09_01_runs_on_atlassian_badge_wasm_probe_experiment", "label": "The wasm-probe throwaway app experiment", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/research/2026-09-01-runs-on-atlassian-badge.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "webtrigger template, nodejs24.x, memoryMB 1024, arm64; five tools, datasets and Pyodide 314.0.6 runtime files as base64 in the bundle, unpacked to /tmp. 17.7 MB zip deployed; the only eligibility finding was the template's dynamic web trigger."}, {"id": "docs_research_2026_09_01_runs_on_atlassian_badge_forge_bundler_drops_wasm", "label": "The Forge bundler drops .wasm and stdlib zip", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/research/2026-09-01-runs-on-atlassian-badge.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Webpack shipped only .cjs output and rewrote Pyodide's dynamic import into a lazy namespace that fails, which is why the runtime files travel as base64 and load from /tmp."}, {"id": "docs_research_2026_09_01_runs_on_atlassian_badge_cpython_wasi", "label": "CPython WASI as an alternative", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/research/2026-09-01-runs-on-atlassian-badge.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Tier 2 platform, 14-15 MB zipped unofficial builds, Node's node:wasi is experimental; no smaller than Pyodide and weaker."}, {"id": "docs_research_2026_09_01_runs_on_atlassian_badge_custom_ui_iframe_pyodide", "label": "Pyodide in the Custom UI iframe", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/research/2026-09-01-runs-on-atlassian-badge.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A .wasm from the app's own static resource is not egress, but WebAssembly compilation needs unsafe-eval in permissions.content.scripts (a major version) and the scheduled weekly brief has no browser to run in, so it is at most half an answer."}, {"id": "docs_research_2026_09_01_runs_on_atlassian_badge_unsafe_eval_csp", "label": "unsafe-eval CSP option for WebAssembly", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/research/2026-09-01-runs-on-atlassian-badge.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "wasm-unsafe-eval is not an allowed value; the community reports unsafe-eval working for a Custom UI in 2023. Adding a CSP option is a major version."}, {"id": "docs_research_2026_09_01_runs_on_atlassian_badge_data_residency_pinned", "label": "PINNED data residency without a remote", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/research/2026-09-01-runs-on-atlassian-badge.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "An app whose in-scope data lives only in Forge hosted storage qualifies for PINNED without configuration. Removing a remotes entry is a minor version; adding one or changing baseUrl is major."}, {"id": "docs_research_2026_09_01_runs_on_atlassian_badge_local_pyodide_measurement", "label": "Local Pyodide measurement on M3 Pro", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/research/2026-09-01-runs-on-atlassian-badge.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "loadPyodide 0.98 s, FC.build 0.37-0.41 s, IN.sequence 4 asks 4.08 s, all byte-identical to native across CPython 3.9, 3.14, Node and Chrome; a backgrounded tab more than doubles the time."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_research_2026_09_01_runs_on_atlassian_badge_research_note", "target": "docs_research_2026_09_01_runs_on_atlassian_badge_runs_on_atlassian_eligibility", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/research/2026-09-01-runs-on-atlassian-badge.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_research_2026_09_01_runs_on_atlassian_badge_runs_on_atlassian_eligibility", "target": "docs_research_2026_09_01_runs_on_atlassian_badge_remote_costs_eligibility", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/research/2026-09-01-runs-on-atlassian-badge.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_research_2026_09_01_runs_on_atlassian_badge_remote_costs_eligibility", "target": "forge_manifest_calculator_remote", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/research/2026-09-01-runs-on-atlassian-badge.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_research_2026_09_01_runs_on_atlassian_badge_research_note", "target": "docs_research_2026_09_01_runs_on_atlassian_badge_pyodide_in_forge_function", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/research/2026-09-01-runs-on-atlassian-badge.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_research_2026_09_01_runs_on_atlassian_badge_pyodide_in_forge_function", "target": "docs_research_2026_09_01_runs_on_atlassian_badge_wasm_probe_experiment", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/research/2026-09-01-runs-on-atlassian-badge.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_research_2026_09_01_runs_on_atlassian_badge_wasm_probe_experiment", "target": "docs_research_2026_09_01_runs_on_atlassian_badge_forge_bundler_drops_wasm", "re